clause_anaphoric_type_counter ::= "if" condition_or_if_it_a "," resolution_counter_placement

/* A leading combat deadline wraps an independently defined destruction. */
/* @sem Operation::CreateDelayedTrigger{event:$turn_end_combat, start:Immediately, body:Program{instructions:[Effect{result:@next, operation:$destroy_combat_history_union}]}} */
